# LOCKED FILES ARCHITECTURE

The following files are strictly LOCKED for layout, structure, and text modifications.
As an AI agent, you must obey these rules or you will corrupt the frontend architecture.

LOCKED FILES:
web/index.html
web/styles.css
web/dj-knowledge.html
web/courses.html
web/jobs.html
web/dj-profile.html
web/dj-dashboard.html

DO NOT:
- restructure DOM
- wrap containers in new divs
- remove hardcoded text
